{"pageid": 747, "title": "Tyler Monitz", "revid": 1900, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Children", "Deceased", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Tyler Monitz</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/18/TylerMonitz.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215173021\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"TylerMonitz\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/18/TylerMonitz.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215173021\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/18/TylerMonitz.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215173021 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/18/TylerMonitz.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241215173021 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"TylerMonitz\" width=\"270\" height=\"318\" data-image-key=\"TylerMonitz.png\" data-image-name=\"TylerMonitz.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Deceased\" title=\"Category:Deceased\">Deceased</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Student</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Stabbed and Bisected by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype mother</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Carly_Monitz\" title=\"Carly Monitz\">Carly Monitz</a> <small>(sister)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #1</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #12</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Tyler Monitz</b> was a young boy living in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> in 2020. A friend of <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Noah\" title=\"Noah\">Noah</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Karl\" title=\"Karl\">Karl</a>, Tyler was killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype mother</span> while at a sleepover with his friends.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Tyler was the older brother of <a href=\"/wiki/Carly_Monitz\" title=\"Carly Monitz\">Carly Monitz</a> and the best friend of <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC12&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC12-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> though this seemed to be a recent development as James remarked that he'd never had \"sleepover friends\" before Tyler.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> The two of them were also close friends with <a href=\"/wiki/Noah\" title=\"Noah\">Noah</a>; when James expressed a crush on <a href=\"/wiki/Karl\" title=\"Karl\">Karl</a>, they encouraged him to ask him out. During one sleepover, they tried to sneak out of James's house, only to get caught.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC6&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC6-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> James would later tell Tyler the story of a monster he supposedly saw near the ravine. This frightened Tyler, and he then used this story to scare his sister and her friends at their own slumber party, resulting in the story spreading enough to form the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">monster</span> in reality.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC12&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC12-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>A week later, Tyler played truth-or-dare with James, Noah and Karl at a sleepover. When James picked \"Truth,\" Tyler asked him what the most scared he'd ever been was, prompting him to tell the story now to Noah and Karl. Noah called bullshit on the story, so James dared him to go look for himself.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> All four boys would go to the ravine to look under the bridge for the creature, with Tyler complaining that he was stepping in deer shit. \n</p><p>The monster would then materialize and attack the boys. Tyler was the last one to die, as a separated James rejoined the group and discovered the carnage. Tyler begged James for help as he was impaled from behind by the Oscuratype's claw, before being ripped in half.\n</p><p>While the deaths would be blamed on a bear originally, people suspected James of killing his friends for a while. A memorial was placed up for Tyler and the other boys at <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak High School (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX0hpZ2hfU2Nob29sP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak High School</span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Eventually, his death would be blamed on <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC15&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC15-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Tyler was a young Caucasian boy with lighter colored hair.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\">Issue #1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\">Issue #6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12\">Issue #12</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"d97b292f1564ad130e0b4a979ab9b26d\" d